    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Online Beach Party For 1-8 Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.poster.avif?t=1754493319\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.webm?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.mp4?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Tower game mode, you can play as a Survivor or as the Soaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Survivor, you start on the wobbly tower and earn stars by staying dry. Push other players off the tower, or work together to plan against the soaker. Use water balloons, geysers, or the ocean to soak other players. Items are dropped when a player gets soaked, even the Soaker's water cannon will be up for grabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Soaker, you start on the beach and earn stars by soaking players. Use the water cannon to push objects into the geysers and launch them towards the tower! You can store the water cannon on your back to use other items, but it will still drop if you get soaked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any player gets soaked, they can still try to earn a star by spin-drying their character and attempting  a bonus challenge. These are things like making nice throws, popping water balloons, reaching flying platforms, and completing jump challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.poster.avif?t=1754493319\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.webm?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.mp4?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Online Beach Party For 1-8 Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.poster.avif?t=1754493319\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.webm?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/11206ae294e24594e574d5828668386b.mp4?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Tower game mode, you can play as a Survivor or as the Soaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Survivor, you start on the wobbly tower and earn stars by staying dry. Push other players off the tower, or work together to plan against the soaker. Use water balloons, geysers, or the ocean to soak other players. Items are dropped when a player gets soaked, even the Soaker's water cannon will be up for grabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Soaker, you start on the beach and earn stars by soaking players. Use the water cannon to push objects into the geysers and launch them towards the tower! You can store the water cannon on your back to use other items, but it will still drop if you get soaked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any player gets soaked, they can still try to earn a star by spin-drying their character and attempting  a bonus challenge. These are things like making nice throws, popping water balloons, reaching flying platforms, and completing jump challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.poster.avif?t=1754493319\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.webm?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738960/extras/802d5b780386c0b95c40ae409fa93f47.mp4?t=1754493319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Soaked is a multiplayer physics sandbox where you fling frisbees, chuck water balloons, and push players to their doom. Join the playtest today!",
